{"id":"n24507-1-8","stage":4,"title":"구석구석 · 每个角落","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n24507-1-8-1","ko":"잃어버렸다던 반지는 찾았어요?","zh":"你说丢失的那枚戒指找到了吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"잃어버렸다던","meaning":"丢，丢失，遗失","explanation":"잃어버리다：丢，丢失，遗失；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；다던：引用以前听到的陈述，修饰后面的名词。","readings":[{"term":"잃어버리다","audio":"/audio/9cf9d89321e22dcf7c31.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68753","senseId":"1","lemma":"잃어버리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잃어버렸다던","audio":"/audio/f10d9409f4c801a15673.mp3"}},{"text":"반지는","meaning":"戒指","explanation":"반지：戒指；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"반지","audio":"/audio/f1e02439b018ae91a9e1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57661","senseId":"1","lemma":"반지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"반지는","audio":"/audio/1354c9fbaa40a9a2de34.mp3"}},{"text":"찾았어요?","meaning":"取回，找回","explanation":"찾다：取回，找回；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"찾다","audio":"/audio/0aa19509314fd87953eb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57320","senseId":"4","lemma":"찾다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"찾았어요","audio":"/audio/9fd43a34a16d05a77ce2.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"9cf9d89321e22dcf","term":"잃어버리다","zh":"丢，丢失，遗失","audio":"/audio/9cf9d89321e22dcf7c31.mp3","entryId":"68753","definition":"丢掉原本拥有的东西而不再拥有。","pronunciation":["이러버리다"]},{"id":"f1e02439b018ae91","term":"반지","zh":"戒指","audio":"/audio/f1e02439b018ae91a9e1.mp3","entryId":"57661","definition":"套在手指上的圆形首饰。","pronunciation":["반지"]},{"id":"0aa19509314fd879","term":"찾다","zh":"取回，找回","audio":"/audio/0aa19509314fd87953eb.mp3","entryId":"57320","definition":"曾经失去、被夺走、寄存的或借出的东西再次收回。","pronunciation":["찯따"]}],"audio":"/audio/ac2ed94fe9ab1de7c4cf.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n24507-1-8-2","ko":"아니요. 집 안 구석구석을 다 찾아봤지만 없었어요.","zh":"没有。我找遍了家里的每个角落，但还是没找到。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아니요.","meaning":"不是，不用","explanation":"아니요：不是，不用。","readings":[{"term":"아니요","audio":"/audio/9474acc7539b7e2cedaf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17189","senseId":"1","lemma":"아니요","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아니요","audio":"/audio/9474acc7539b7e2cedaf.mp3"}},{"text":"집","meaning":"家，屋","explanation":"집：家，屋。","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"2","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"里，里面","explanation":"안：里，里面。","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74890","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"구석구석을","meaning":"每个角落，犄角旮旯","explanation":"구석구석：每个角落，犄角旮旯；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"구석구석","audio":"/audio/d7b1fe909c065703064d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24507","senseId":"1","lemma":"구석구석","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"구석구석을","audio":"/audio/895b26806f9e15fd1a51.mp3"}},{"text":"다","meaning":"全，都","explanation":"다：全，都。","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58175","senseId":"1","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}},{"text":"찾아봤지만","meaning":"查找，翻找","explanation":"찾아보다：查找，翻找；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；지만：表示转折或让步：“但是、虽然”。","readings":[{"term":"찾아보다","audio":"/audio/a3eafbcd1004a6ce98a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29758","senseId":"2","lemma":"찾아보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"찾아봤지만","audio":"/audio/5de8e926a6cfbbc8a03a.mp3"}},{"text":"없었어요.","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"1",